acts</div></div></div><div class="flex items-center justify-start"><div class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 border border-gs-stroke-tertiary bg-gs-surface-back"><div class="font-sans font-normal text-[13px] text-gs-text-secondary">The Graph compatible</div></div></div><div class="flex items-center justify-start"><div class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 border border-gs-stroke-tertiary bg-gs-surface-back"><div class="font-sans font-normal text-[13px] text-gs-text-secondary">Historical data</div></div></div><div class="flex items-center justify-start"><div class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 border border-gs-stroke-tertiary bg-gs-surface-back"><div class="font-sans font-normal text-[13px] text-gs-text-secondary">Custom schemas</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="py-8 lg:py-12"><div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center w-full"><div class="flex-1 flex flex-col items-center lg:items-start gap-8 max-w-[520px]"><div class="flex flex-col items-center lg:items-start gap-6 text-center lg:text-left"><div class="flex flex-col items-center lg:items-start gap-2"><div class="text-gs-heading-xl flex-1 flex flex-col"><div class="flex items-center justify-start mb-2 justify-center lg:justify-start"><div class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full gap-1.5 px-0 py-0"><div class="font-mono font-medium text-[14px] tracking-wide leading-tight uppercase text-gs-edge">Edge RPC</div></div></div><h3 class="font-medium leading-tight" id="product-edge-rpc"><span class="sr-only">Edge RPC: </span>Read, write, and interact with blockchain state</h3></div></div><p class="text-gs-text-secondary text-gs-body-lg flex-1 leading-normal sm:leading-tight text-balance">One RPC endpoint for live and archive access to EVM chains. Backed by a global edge network with sensible features like automatic failover and cross-node consensus.</p><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-[12px] transition-[background-color,border-color,box-shadow,transform] duration-gs-press ease-gs-out focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-gs-text-quaternary focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-gs-background disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:shadow-none disabled:translate-y-0 motion-reduce:transition-none motion-reduce:transform-none bg-[rgba(255,255,255,0.16)] relative px-4 py-3 border border-[rgba(255,255,255,0.2)] hover:bg-[rgba(255,255,255,0.55)] active:bg-[rgba(255,255,255,0.40)] h-10 my-4" href="/products/edge"><p class="text-gs-text-primary font-normal text-[16px] inline-flex items-center gap-1 leading-[1.35] whitespace-pre text-gs-white">Learn more<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></p></a><div class="flex flex-col gap-8 w-full mt-4 mb-8 lg:mb-0 lg:mt-0"><div class="flex flex-col gap-3 w-full"><p class="text-gs-text-secondary text-gs-body-sm font-medium tracking-wide uppercase text-center lg:text-left">Features</p><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1 justify-center lg:justify-start"><div class="flex items-center justify-start"><div class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 border border-gs-stroke-tertiary bg-gs-surface-back"><div class="font-sans font-normal text-[13px] text-gs-text-secondary">Global edge CDN</div></div></div><div class="flex items-center justify-start"><div class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 border border-gs-stroke-tertiary bg-gs-surface-back"><div class="font-sans font-normal text-[13px] text-gs-text-secondary">Millisecond failover</div></div></div><div class="flex items-center justify-start"><div class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 border border-gs-stroke-tertiary bg-gs-surface-back"><div class="font-sans font-normal text-[13px] text-gs-text-secondary">Cross-node consensus</div></div></div><div class="flex items-center justify-start"><div class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 border border-gs-stroke-tertiary bg-gs-surface-back"><div class="font-sans font-normal text-[13px] text-gs-text-secondary">Automatic retries</div></div></div><div class="flex items-center justify-start"><div class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 border border-gs-stroke-tertiary bg-gs-surface-back"><div class="font-sans font-normal text-[13px] text-gs-text-secondary">Request hedging</div></div></div><div class="flex items-center justify-start"><div class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 border border-gs-stroke-tertiary bg-gs-surface-back"><div class="font-sans font-normal text-[13px] text-gs-text-secondary">Circuit breakers</div></div></div><div class="flex items-center justify-start"><div class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 border border-gs-stroke-tertiary bg-gs-surface-back"><div class="font-sans font-normal text-[13px] text-gs-text-secondary">Tip-of-chain caching</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="relative flex-shrink overflow-visible min-w-0 min-h-[300px]"><div class="relative"><img alt="Illustration of Goldsky&#x27;s Edge RPC infrastructure" draggable="false" loading="lazy" width="430" height="300" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="max-w-full h-auto" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhome%2Fproducts%2Fedge-rpc.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhome%2Fproducts%2Fedge-rpc.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhome%2Fproducts%2Fedge-rpc.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75"/></div></div></div></div><div class="py-8 lg:py-12"><div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center justify-between w-full"><div class